  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for busybox",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for busybox fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2023-42366: heap-buffer-overflow in the next_token function (bsc#1217586).\n- CVE-2026-38752: Denial of Service via crafted AWK script (bsc#1271544).\n- CVE-2026-38753: use-after-free in awk_sub() (bsc#1271545).\n- CVE-2026-38754: heap overflow in ifsbreakup() (bsc#1271547).\n- CVE-2026-38755: heap overflow in evalcommand() (bsc#1271548).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
